2 \\ln|\\sin{\\left(y \\right)}|+C\\end{aligned}\n$$", ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy"}, "generation": {"version": "quotient-private-2275-v1", "seed": 0, "template": "q-49557", "profile": "method", "parameters": {"m": 1}, "source_basis": 2275, "source_lineage": "01a12a15-3e0a-75a1-9dac-f8b8c5d5c3f1", "source_question": "q-49557", "evidence_only": false, "eligible_for_learning": true, "mathematical_fingerprint": "ed34ef9cb38820741e3d3772d1d3b8dcc2ad02c73cf65474869350ebd487125c", "content_fingerprint": "dc2780f1e82ba9e0a4ef49fb7dbdab4a7e09a3b6f3b5a4ab730c86d0aa916f0c", "domain": "Connected real intervals excluding every displayed denominator zero and trigonometric pole (including choices); real logarithms use absolute values. Definite limits lie in a common pole-free interval with strictly positive substitution.", "recipe_policy": "Complete method-derived substitution-operation bank.", "dependencies": {"python": "3.13.5", "sympy": "1.14.0"}, "math_format": "course-academy-tex-v1"}}, "checks": [{"submitted": "999999", "expected": "unresolved", "purpose": "foreign numerical fixture ID"}, {"submitted": "not-an-id", "expected": "unresolved", "purpose": "malformed radio ID"}, {"submitted": "- 2 \\ln|\\sin{\\left(y \\right)}|+C", "expected": "unresolved", "purpose": "mathtext is not a radio ID"}]}]